all think differently about what we eat and why we should re consider our actions.\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Voice for Plant Based News Vegan Film "}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Lets think differently about what we eat!</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/renton-trainspotting-choose-life-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Renton Trainspotting Choose Life","aria-label":"Previous: Renton Trainspotting Choose Life","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/crowd-hub-x-explainer-video-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Crowd Hub X Explainer Voice","aria-label":"Next: Crowd Hub X Explainer Voice","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Plant Based News</h2>\r\n<p>Plant Based News is a UK-based website about veganism and plant-based living, founded by Klaus Mitchell and Robbie Lockie<br>\r\nI'd been watching this channel for several years and had changed my food choices massively since discovering the channel.<br>Watching this would make more people think differently and that can only be good for our planet.\r\n</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/h7c0tbf-iaY","title":"Voice for Plant Based News Vegan Film ","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/vegan-film-voiceover.jpg","alt":"vegan-film-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Voice for Plant Based News Vegan Film "}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>Professional Male Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>Plant Based News were looking for a great <a href=\"/apple-voice-style\" title=\"Male VoiceOver\">Male VoiceOver</a> to play the part of a controversial radio host. I knew exactly who they were wanting to emulate. And whilst I'm not capable of matching the voice completely, they were very happy with the voice and performance I gave.<br>The visuals are stunning and I was proud of the association.\r\n</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>Where can I get a professional British Male voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for a British Male Voiceover to be a part of your project? Do send some of the scripts I can give a custom audition and if I'm right for the project I'd love to chat further. <br><a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">Get in touch today</a> \r\n</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Voice for Plant Based News Vegan Film ","pageUrl":"vegan-film-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","934",{"href":"/renton-trainspotting-choose-life-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[